DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270620
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270622
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Nikitas (patron)\, Mandraki
LOCATION:Mandraki\, Nisyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's patron saint is celebrated in Mandraki on 20-21 June with a procession of the icon through the village and a glendi. It opens the summer season of panigiria on Nisyros.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/nisyros/#mandraki-panigiri-of-agios-nikitas-patron-mandraki
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/nisyros/#mandraki-panigiri-of-agios-nikitas-patron-mandraki
END:VEVENT
